# Stress-matrix runs (scripts/stress_matrix.py): the rolling "latest" output is
# regenerated on every run and would otherwise be a noisy diff on every commit.
# A versioned report (artifacts/stress/stress-engine-<version>.json) is meant to be
# committed explicitly as release evidence and is NOT covered by this rule.
artifacts/stress/latest.json
artifacts/stress/latest-*.json
